{"body":"fix: patch critical OS-level, memory, and concurrency vulnerabilities

This commit addresses four systemic failure points in the core CLI runtime 
that cause silent failures, panics, and security risks under edge conditions:

- opencode: Scope session temp dirs to the repository `.git` directory to 
  prevent local symlink attacks and arbitrary file overwrites via `/tmp`.
- git_operations: Batch `git fetch` arguments by hash chunks (500 max) to 
  prevent operating system `ARG_MAX` exhaustion on heavy repository syncs.
- redact: Return deep copies of `PIIConfig` maps in `getPIIConfig()` to 
  prevent concurrent map read/write panics across concurrent goroutines.
- utils: Refactor `copyFile` to use `io.Copy` and `os.Root.OpenFile` for 
  O(1) memory streaming, preventing OOM faults on massive LLM transcripts.","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOQyo98M8AAAABC3vA7A","author":{"login":"mrvenom17"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"Any new update on this lil one?","createdAt":"2026-05-19T12:17:50Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/799#issuecomment-4487626988","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"files":[{"path":"cmd/entire/cli/agent/claudecode/claude.go","additions":57,"deletions":22,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cmd/entire/cli/agent/geminicli/gemini.go","additions":6,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cmd/entire/cli/agent/opencode/opencode.go","additions":10,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cmd/entire/cli/git_operations.go","additions":29,"deletions":17,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cmd/entire/cli/session/state.go","additions":10,"deletions":0,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"cmd/entire/cli/utils.go","additions":9,"deletions":3,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"redact/pii.go","additions":25,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"reviews":[{"id":"PRR_kwDOQyo98M7wCL0M","author":{"login":"claude"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Claude Code Review

